  "title": "Moo Shu Pork",
  "description": "Moo shu pork, or mu shu, is an easy and delicious Chinese stir-fried dish of marinated pork, mushrooms, ginger, and egg, served in Chinese pancakes with hoisin sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Lindsay"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:37:34-04:00",
